This product includes data derived from SO-ARM100 by TheRobotStudio
(https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
src/model.c holds the joint origins, joint limits, link masses and centres of mass of
Simulation/SO101/so101_new_calib.urdf, and points sampled from the STL meshes it names
(generated by tools/gen_model.py).

It answers the calls of LeRobot's RobotKinematics (lerobot.model.kinematics) and drives the
Feetech STS servos by the register map of LeRobot's Feetech motor tables, both from LeRobot by
Hugging Face (https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. No LeRobot code is included.

so101_atan2 (src/so101ik_internal.h) uses the rational approximation of the arctangent from
atan.c of the Cephes Math Library by Stephen L. Moshier.

Not affiliated with TheRobotStudio or Hugging Face.
